# Admin routes: `<path> <METHOD>,...`, the methods the admin router answers
# on that path (not 404 "unknown admin endpoint" and not 405). Paths come from
# the router's own endpoint list in its 404 body; `{id}`-style segments are
# probed with sample values. Paths matched on path alone answer every method.
# Methods probed: GET, POST, PUT, DELETE.
#
# Produced by contract_golden_e2e.rs against the --config dialect binary with
# LLMPROXY_ADMIN_TOKEN unset, so every gated route refuses with 403 and no probe
# changes state. Response bodies and status codes are not covered here.
# NOT COVERED: `/ui/<asset>` paths and the `/` redirect (present only when the
# admin UI bundle is loaded), query parameters, and request/response bodies.
# Regenerate with `make golden`; review every changed line.
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys GET,POST
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys/{id} DELETE
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys/{id}/budget PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys/{id}/limits PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys/{id}/policy PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys/{id}/spend GET
/chains/{stat_prefix}/keys/{id}/tags PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/pricing GET,PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants POST
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id} DELETE
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/budget PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/limits PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/objects/{object_id} GET,PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/policy PUT
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/provider_credentials GET
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/provider_credentials/{provider} PUT,DELETE
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/spend GET
/chains/{stat_prefix}/tenants/{id}/trace_export GET,PUT
/clusters GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/config_dump GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/drain_listeners POST
/healthcheck/fail POST
/healthcheck/ok POST
/keys GET,POST
/keys/{id} DELETE
/keys/{id}/budget PUT
/keys/{id}/limits PUT
/keys/{id}/policy PUT
/keys/{id}/spend GET
/keys/{id}/tags PUT
/ledger/ack POST
/ledger/entries GET
/models GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/pricing GET,PUT
/ready GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/server_info GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/stats GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/stats/prometheus GET,POST,PUT,DELETE
/tenants POST
/tenants/{id} DELETE
/tenants/{id}/budget PUT
/tenants/{id}/limits PUT
/tenants/{id}/objects/{object_id} GET,PUT
/tenants/{id}/policy PUT
/tenants/{id}/provider_credentials GET
/tenants/{id}/provider_credentials/{provider} PUT,DELETE
/tenants/{id}/spend GET
/tenants/{id}/trace_export GET,PUT
/traces/capture GET,POST
/ui GET
